      "id": "claim_33833b3a05f24f18b381a2ec1900f7ca",
      "statement": "The SegmentWriter is the single place segments emit colored, glyph-decorated text: it owns the resolved theme and style, restores an active color when nested colored_with/icon spans pop, renders icons only when the style enables them, and exposes window_gap() for joining related windows inside one segment.",
