      "id": "claim_5fdf61f304af4f9297bbf8eba1c49b35",
      "statement": "The RateLimits segment renders both the 5-hour and weekly (7-day) windows in one segment joined by SegmentWriter::window_gap(), shows the weekly window only once used_percentage reaches the weekly_show_at threshold, validates every percentage through pct_in_range (rounds and accepts only 0..=999 to reject leaked epoch timestamps while allowing over-limit values), and emits nothing when neither window has anything to show.",
