    {
      "id": "claim_8ffecc4d65174c73a873ee89b60db451",
      "statement": "With limit_sync enabled, the RateLimits segment records each session's 5-hour and (threshold-crossing) 7-day snapshots to a shared cross-session store and prefers the shared high-water mark when it still describes a live (future-reset) window, otherwise falling back to the session's own values.",
